    "type": "game",
    "name": "Border Patrol Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3411430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the challenging role of a border patrol officer in <strong>Border Patrol Simulator</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage security, investigate suspicious travelers, and make tough decisions in a dynamic, ever-changing world. Analyze documents, uncover smuggling attempts, and balance empathy with duty as you navigate ethical dilemmas and high-pressure situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udec2 <strong>Realistic Inspections</strong>: Verify IDs, search vehicles, and uncover hidden contraband.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Dynamic Events</strong>: Handle unpredictable situations like emergencies, protests, and VIP visits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Career Progression</strong>: Upgrade your tools, train your canine companion, and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude94 <strong>Patrol Car Operations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the road in your fully equipped patrol car, the backbone of your border security missions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Border Patrol Drives</strong>: Patrol vast stretches of terrain, from highways to rugged backroads, ensuring no area goes unchecked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Inspections</strong>: Use onboard tools to scan for hidden compartments, contraband, or unauthorized passengers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuit Mode</strong>: Engage in high-speed chases to intercept fleeing vehicles or suspicious targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Customization</strong>: Enhance your patrol car with better engines, off-road capabilities, and advanced scanning technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/b9ef6b8aa277c479a9f81aff1ea514be.poster.avif?t=1741179532\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/b9ef6b8aa277c479a9f81aff1ea514be.webm?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/b9ef6b8aa277c479a9f81aff1ea514be.mp4?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Drone Patrol Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies with a state-of-the-art drone to monitor vast borderlands.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Spot unauthorized crossings, abandoned vehicles, or suspicious activity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Assistance</strong>: Relay real-time intel to ground units for swift action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Drone</strong>: Enhance range, thermal imaging, and detection systems to stay ahead of threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a bird\u2019s-eye view of the action and ensure no danger goes unnoticed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/777235b1b2ec638cee72f047f6280805.poster.avif?t=1741179532\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/777235b1b2ec638cee72f047f6280805.webm?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/777235b1b2ec638cee72f047f6280805.mp4?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc15 <strong>Rudy, Your Loyal Patrol Dog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Rudy, your trusted canine partner who brings unmatched instincts to the field.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracking</strong>: Follow footprints or scents to locate hidden contraband and fleeing suspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Rescue</strong>: Assist in finding lost travelers or those in need of help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training and Bonding</strong>: Improve Rudy\u2019s skills and strengthen your partnership for peak performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rudy\u2019s sharp senses and unwavering loyalty will become one of your greatest assets on the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/6add98bd47189e752452df5e0192fb42.poster.avif?t=1741179532\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/6add98bd47189e752452df5e0192fb42.webm?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/6add98bd47189e752452df5e0192fb42.mp4?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to secure the border? Suit up, gear up, and step into the action with <strong>Border Patrol Simulator</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the challenging role of a border patrol officer in <strong>Border Patrol Simulator</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage security, investigate suspicious travelers, and make tough decisions in a dynamic, ever-changing world. Analyze documents, uncover smuggling attempts, and balance empathy with duty as you navigate ethical dilemmas and high-pressure situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udec2 <strong>Realistic Inspections</strong>: Verify IDs, search vehicles, and uncover hidden contraband.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Dynamic Events</strong>: Handle unpredictable situations like emergencies, protests, and VIP visits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Career Progression</strong>: Upgrade your tools, train your canine companion, and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude94 <strong>Patrol Car Operations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the road in your fully equipped patrol car, the backbone of your border security missions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Border Patrol Drives</strong>: Patrol vast stretches of terrain, from highways to rugged backroads, ensuring no area goes unchecked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle Inspections</strong>: Use onboard tools to scan for hidden compartments, contraband, or unauthorized passengers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursuit Mode</strong>: Engage in high-speed chases to intercept fleeing vehicles or suspicious targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Customization</strong>: Enhance your patrol car with better engines, off-road capabilities, and advanced scanning technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/b9ef6b8aa277c479a9f81aff1ea514be.poster.avif?t=1741179532\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/b9ef6b8aa277c479a9f81aff1ea514be.webm?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/b9ef6b8aa277c479a9f81aff1ea514be.mp4?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Drone Patrol Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies with a state-of-the-art drone to monitor vast borderlands.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Spot unauthorized crossings, abandoned vehicles, or suspicious activity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Assistance</strong>: Relay real-time intel to ground units for swift action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Drone</strong>: Enhance range, thermal imaging, and detection systems to stay ahead of threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a bird\u2019s-eye view of the action and ensure no danger goes unnoticed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/777235b1b2ec638cee72f047f6280805.poster.avif?t=1741179532\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/777235b1b2ec638cee72f047f6280805.webm?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/777235b1b2ec638cee72f047f6280805.mp4?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc15 <strong>Rudy, Your Loyal Patrol Dog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Rudy, your trusted canine partner who brings unmatched instincts to the field.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracking</strong>: Follow footprints or scents to locate hidden contraband and fleeing suspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Rescue</strong>: Assist in finding lost travelers or those in need of help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training and Bonding</strong>: Improve Rudy\u2019s skills and strengthen your partnership for peak performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rudy\u2019s sharp senses and unwavering loyalty will become one of your greatest assets on the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/6add98bd47189e752452df5e0192fb42.poster.avif?t=1741179532\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/6add98bd47189e752452df5e0192fb42.webm?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411430/extras/6add98bd47189e752452df5e0192fb42.mp4?t=1741179532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to secure the border? Suit up, gear up, and step into the action with <strong>Border Patrol Simulator</strong>!</p>",
